     "expected": {"$id": "card:1", "name": "one", "tags": ["", "B", "a", "b", "é", "é", "", "𐀀"], "ints": [], "nums": []},
     "expectedTagsCodepoints": [[], ["U+0042"], ["U+0061"], ["U+0062"], ["U+0065", "U+0301"], ["U+00E9"], ["U+E000"], ["U+10000"]],
     "citations": ["Q8f", "ACC-4.2.11", "R3-SKETCH-DOC", "R01-D5"],
     "note": "8 distinct values from 9 assertions. NFC U+00E9 and NFD e+U+0301 stay distinct (ACC 6.1). UTF-16 code-unit order would put U+10000 (D800 DC00) before U+E000; locale collation would interleave case. Empty card-many attributes are [] (always an array)."},
